<item>
<title>菲防长：如中国动武可援引条约让美军介入中媒：废纸一张近日中方与菲律宾政界爆发口水战，中国驻菲大使井泉称如对菲动武可轻易取</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10396</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10396</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:19:07 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>菲防长：如中国动武可援引条约让美军介入<br/>中媒：废纸一张</b><br/><br/>近日中方与菲律宾政界爆发口水战，中国驻菲大使井泉称如对菲动武可轻易取胜，但中国爱好和平，言论引发菲律宾政界反弹，有议员动议驱逐井泉出境。<br/><br/>菲律宾当地华文报引用消息称，中方正考虑十项反制措施，包括拖走该舰、停止补给、断供成品油化肥，中方未证实。菲律宾防长特奥多罗10月23日警告，中国若以武力拖走坐滩仁爱礁的“马德雷山”号军舰，将构成“战争行为”。<br/><br/>特奥多罗又称，若中方人员登舰，可能援引《美菲共同防御条约》要求美军共同应对，但由总统马科斯决定。中媒《环球时报》批评特奥多罗想躲在美国身后恐吓中国，称任何“条约”在与中国开战的风险面前只是废纸。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%8B">#军事</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7">#南海</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4">#外交</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%8F%B2%E5%BE%8B%E5%AE%BE">#菲律宾</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《美国之音》<a href="https://www.voachinese.com/a/philippine-warns-china-towing-away-brp-sierra-madre-would-be-act-of-war-20261023/8214549.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">菲律宾就第二托马斯浅滩军舰警告中国：拖走“马德雷山”号将被视为“战争行为”</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaobao.com/news/china/story20261019-9859661" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">菲律宾外交部召见中国驻菲大使 抗议“动武可轻易取胜”言论</a><br/>《凤凰网》<a href="https://news.ifeng.com/c/8xVD4AHlGH2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">“菲律宾防长提着纸糊的盾牌对中国发起冲锋”</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/b0UXOYSYFR55Cpq6UW0GqjY8UtRsiKh8rRH_YH0BEaOhV0Zth07C3qAw2L97ppS4xPrUMlxuK4rlhd0_kfEGxkc1lLbaIr1bvxAYYYgyR_MWwcYzpFoFL9CNZYIJcQBLKo_Mer-1QTDv9wFHF66DK3CzrFI2qi5N7TNBZuqueJGvF-pnObVxw2aU_Cf2PusIjk_BUBy32ZErzcRuPEkM0GTSKWm54zcjQDV2UXzBJSycA6noxlc3aHa12WFR2F7Xth4Ar7M5Kjp2acRwvHKEamr6_lIQFh_BYKfiGs1NSSEqDE61KAyTuKM9ULTQ7q4PtdZC6P0LKTrEBrAds0atoA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/u2htNIMPIIsj1fz_R42F6yeLYwMDsUKMuPmBmr0PhjFMHsie2spZcbh97foMomyIBZgb5MKjsa3vPv1FNxk66rBvBq9D6Nr51I26A-pI2lT91r7gsBz3SP_T6xo7wklIVtbsRacIVav9A0DZWY6L0FyL_4df1rEgeGoh_5-sxdpIGqwIannVAO6boV7qkONmz4zD9MUc9uvXLps-pylSK3I1dON1Zz1Ie_wQ-wpPsknVV6ni1DJyo6o6MNDQnxSeUwP5FjsV-Rv3JAq3GNEq8rVe-QsMUqNl88cWr9uWGd02J1kmrEOeIsRpmoWH20Yfz9OWtLGCm1B113GL5jnUCw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/SXpldyriu3vU5vBCCr3b9CU39Iv7hMIoDzC8PYemvq367_VghrvpY1S10jUkulv0QasfERC8M9_6_2tZlWDMgzpV5iVrvF2bYzADar-4Z1tm_tHK_xNXVXAS73vehEmdBRqiod0uLfD6Dfp9kPcT42b0k4fzDBoYfOx45jS1uc5YQmTqrnOwC70Wu4vMMkBFwQHzb8vlajDjb4XxunvVGyESRTQBrVu5UyNpZGWncn3ftRw_lG12hqM7Wre6OLQylNELymaBrrP6aoZw-zTR88qEqCYXzRxFw7yfBdwDapV30fG8_9QiHh_dD5voU4-qK6L7kOXxsNRwxDdLvXAqBA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/JaVHM0tGf4sadbJ3SFb6O7nhBhb-QzhRTNAJoQNoZEUa-OP3wWxopaqWjMUpZh_4mwi1oDIh635mZtLQaKW8ze8wv8W1L0EgMvq0CVbF2NiDA8fxgX9Nq-g0UfqoWZZOAR53gZVS2waecXAqgU9uFub0TTvHSKeaqe4_c0YWBledJZWw4qhxrS8cy9nnk1wiGZVVpVYsaeyIiuaK3z2lToiArCuxVbnPwTMkagGmvvmb0BIRmKlGWS0yewTbDYTecBri0s_XxNVpk3BzXZfVTmNjebs3DfETgsN751F7BVaLS8z2VErNBtwTUxVHUg2FdAiiMyIF-3ahSub6aHmPtw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style